### List notifications
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notifications?page=1&limit=10

### Search notifications
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notifications?q=The

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/notifications/notifications-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Golden Hour Notification",
  "channel": "Email",
  "audience": "Agents",
  "date": "2026-12-08"
}
